questions.question:
What is the time complexity of this loop?
i = 1;
while (i < n) i = i * 2;

What is the time complexity?
for (i = 1; i <= n; i++)
  for (j = 1; j <= i; j++)
    count++;

What is the time complexity?
for (i = 1; i <= n; i++)
  for (j = 1; j < n; j = j * 2)
    count++;

What is the time complexity?
for (i = n; i > 0; i = i / 2)
  for (j = 0; j < i; j++)
    count++;
